# BIRD Mini-Dev: 4 GB of SQLite databases plus a 1 GB SQL dump per dialect.
# Fetched, not committed — scripts/eval_bird.py expects
# evals/bird/minidev/MINIDEV/dev_databases/. The run records under
# evals/bird/results/ are small and stay tracked.
evals/bird/minidev/
evals/bird/*.zip
evals/bird/__MACOSX/
